  "description": "*“Date me for 20,000 won an hour.”* \n\nCha Do-Hyeon is a poor college student. One day, he received an absurd proposal from Lee Sa-Na, a junior in his department. Should he accept this girl’s proposal to find a suitable spot on campus to bury a body? Everything seemed suspicious, but for Do-Hyeon, who had just been fired from his part-time job, it was an offer too sweet to refuse!\n\n*“It really pays to have money, doesn’t it?”\n\n“Keep those thoughts to yourself!”*\n\nA suspicious “dating-for-hire” service between a woman who has nothing but money and a man who has nothing but no money.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
